Qt5 Licensing
-------------
This program uses the Qt5 Framework.
Qt is licensed separately under LGPL (2.1 or 3.0).
Users must be able to replace Qt shared libraries in the application directory.

If you distribute binaries:
- Keep Qt5 DLLs/shared libs separate (do NOT statically link unless you have a Qt commercial license)
- Include a reference to the Qt license (already inside LICENSE)
- Recommended: include a link to Qt sources if required by LGPL

